    "地震法术不能对 [储金罐](/upgrade/0404-Gold-Storage)、[圣水瓶](/upgrade/0405-Elixir-Storage) 和 [暗黑重油罐](/upgrade/0406-Dark-Elixir-Storage) 造成伤害。",
